This subpackage contains OpenGL drivers for small display controllers and specialty panels:

* GM12U320 - Generalplus GM12U320 projector controller
* hx8357d - HannStar hx8357d display controller
* ili9163, ili9225, ili9341, ili9486 - ILI9xxx series display controllers
* mi0283qt - MI0283QT display module
* panel-mipi-dbi - MIPI DBI interface panels
* repaper_dri.so - Repaper e-paper display driver
* ssd130x - SSD130x OLED displays
* st7586, st7735r - ST display controllers
